window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Things have gotten a little complicated. Asmodeus and I thought we could win the game, but we were wrong. It's only just beginning.<br> <br> Determined to keep us apart, Lucifer drags me into a world of flames. There's only one way out. I have to sign a demon contract. Again.<br> <br> But the terms of the deal are far worse than I could have ever imagined. Lucifer offers the unthinkable. He'll end the brutal game for souls and spare the world from eternal torment.<br> <br> On one condition.<br> <br> I must rip out Az's heart.<br> <br> <b><i>This is the final book in the Demons After Dark: Covenant trilogy.</i></b><br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
